     ],
     "text": "per petiole, leaflets are absent and no anthocyanin is"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.0,
      63.36,
      257.28,
      72.48
     ],
     "text": "present. The white flowers appear moderately early,"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.48,
      73.44,
      280.32,
      82.56
     ],
     "text": "lasting only a short period. The pods of \u2018Bluey\u2019 are slightly"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.0,
      83.04,
      268.32,
      92.16
     ],
     "text": "curved and mostly with an obtuse angled point. \u2018Bluey\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.0,
      93.12,
      265.44,
      101.76
     ],
     "text": "differs from \u2018Dinkum\u2019 by having green cotyledons, and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.0,
      102.72,
      277.92,
      111.36
     ],
     "text": "from \u2018Buckley\u2019 by being semi-leafless, semi-dwarf and by"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.48,
      112.8,
      285.6,
      121.44
     ],
     "text": "having larger seeds. The seeds of \u2018Bluey\u2019 are globose, have"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      48.48,
      122.88,
      223.2,
      130.56
     ],
     "text": "a white seed coat and an occasional dimple."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "per petiole, leaflets are absent and no anthocyanin is\npresent. The white flowers appear moderately early,\nlasting only a short period. The pods of \u2018Bluey\u2019 are slightly\ncurved and mostly with an obtuse angled point. \u2018Bluey\u2019\ndiffers from \u2018Dinkum\u2019 by having green cotyledons, and\nfrom \u2018Buckley\u2019 by being semi-leafless, semi-dwarf and by\nhaving larger seeds. The seeds of \u2018Bluey\u2019 are globose, have\na white seed coat and an occasional dimple.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
